{'symbol': 'EXC', 'date': '2019-11-20 11:30:00', 'title': 'Exelon Generation To Begin Negotiations To Acquire RE Ginna, Nine Mile Point And Calvert Cliffs', 'text': "EXELON GENERATION TO BEGIN NEGOTIATIONS TO ACQUIRE FULL OWNERSHIP OF R.E. GINNA, NINE MILE POINT AND CALVERT CLIFFS.EXELON GENERATION - AS PART OF ACQUISITION PROCESS, EDF AND EXELON GENERATION WILL SEEK A NEGOTIATED AGREEMENT ON SALE PRICE.EXELON - TRANSACTION WILL REQUIRE APPROVAL BY NEW YORK PUBLIC SERVICE COMMISSION, FEDERAL ENERGY REGULATORY COMMISSION & NUCLEAR REGULATORY COMMISSION.EXELON GENERATION - IF AGREEMENT CANNOT BE REACHED FOR DEAL, PRICE WILL BE SET THROUGH THIRD-PARTY ARBITRATION PROCESS TO DETERMINE FAIR MARKET VALUE.EXELON GENERATION - CO'S PURCHASE OF EDF'S OWNERSHIP INTEREST WILL HAVE NO IMPACT ON PLANT OPERATIONS OR EMPLOYEES."}
